{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"sql-plus","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.0.0","displayName":"SQL Dialects","description":"Syntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for SQL Dialects (.psql .pgsql .mysql .plsql).","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Languages"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"languages":[{"id":"sql-plus","name":"SQL Dialects","extensions":[".psql",".pgsql",".mysql",".plsql",".tsql",".ddl",".dml",".prc",".fnc"],"grammar":"grammars/sql-plus.json","lineComment":"--","blockComment":["/*","*/"]}],"snippets":[{"language":"SQL Dialects","path":"snippets/sql-plus.json"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"grammars/sql-plus.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"ignoreCase\": true,\n  \"rules\": [\n    {\n      \"begin\": \"\\\\/\\\\*\",\n      \"end\": \"\\\\*\\\\/\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\-\\\\-.*$\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"#.*$\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\"(?:[^\\\"\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*\\\"\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"'(?:[^'\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*'\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:0[xX][0-9a-fA-F_]+|0[bB][01_]+|0[oO][0-7_]+|\\\\d[\\\\d_]*(?:\\\\.\\\\d[\\\\d_]*)?(?:[eE][+-]?\\\\d+)?)[uUlLfFdDnNiI]{0,3}\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"number\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:materialized|transaction|constraint|references|returning|temporary|recursive|partition|procedure|extension|database|distinct|restrict|rollback|truncate|language|function|sequence|between|cascade|default|foreign|primary|replace|trigger|explain|analyze|declare|returns|column|commit|create|delete|exists|having|insert|offset|revoke|select|unique|update|values|window|cursor|return|schema|alter|begin|check|cross|grant|group|index|inner|limit|order|outer|right|table|union|using|where|fetch|case|desc|drop|else|from|full|into|join|left|like|null|then|view|when|with|over|loop|add|all|and|any|asc|end|key|not|set|as|by|if|in|is|on|or)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"keyword\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:false|true|null)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"constant\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:timestamptz|bigserial|timestamp|smallint|integer|varchar|boolean|numeric|decimal|bigint|serial|double|float|jsonb|bytea|text|char|bool|date|time|real|json|uuid|blob|int)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"type\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:json_build_object|row_number|dense_rank|string_agg|date_trunc|substring|array_agg|coalesce|replace|extract|nullif|concat|length|count|lower|upper|round|floor|cast|trim|ceil|rank|lead|sum|avg|min|max|now|lag)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"function\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b[A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_]*(?=\\\\s*\\\\()\",\n      \"token\": \"function\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"},"snippets/sql-plus.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"Create table\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"ct\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"CREATE TABLE ${1:name} (\",\n      \"\\tid BIGSERIAL PRIMARY KEY,\",\n      \"\\t${2:column} ${3:TEXT} NOT NULL,\",\n      \"\\tcreated_at TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT now()\",\n      \");\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"CREATE TABLE\"\n  },\n  \"Select\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"sel\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"SELECT ${1:*}\",\n      \"FROM ${2:table}\",\n      \"WHERE ${3:condition};\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"SELECT\"\n  },\n  \"Join\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"jn\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"JOIN ${1:other} ON ${1:other}.${2:id} = ${3:table}.${4:other_id}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"JOIN\"\n  },\n  \"CTE\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"cte\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"WITH ${1:name} AS (\",\n      \"\\tSELECT $0\",\n      \")\",\n      \"SELECT * FROM ${1:name};\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A common table expression\"\n  },\n  \"Index\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"idx\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"CREATE INDEX ${1:idx_name} ON ${2:table} (${3:column});\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"CREATE INDEX\"\n  },\n  \"Upsert (Postgres)\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"ups\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"INSERT INTO ${1:table} (${2:cols}) VALUES (${3:vals})\",\n      \"ON CONFLICT (${4:id}) DO UPDATE SET ${5:col} = EXCLUDED.${5:col};\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"INSERT ... ON CONFLICT\"\n  }\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# SQL Dialects\n\nSyntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for SQL Dialects.\n\n## Files\n\n`.psql`, `.pgsql`, `.mysql`, `.plsql`, `.tsql`, `.ddl`, `.dml`, `.prc`, `.fnc`\n\n## Features\n\n- Colors keywords, types, strings, numbers, comments and more. The colors follow your theme.\n- **Toggle Line Comment** (Ctrl+/) uses `--`.\n- 6 snippets.\n\n## Snippets\n\nType the prefix and press Tab.\n\n| Prefix | What it inserts |\n| --- | --- |\n| `ct` | CREATE TABLE |\n| `sel` | SELECT |\n| `jn` | JOIN |\n| `cte` | A common table expression |\n| `idx` | CREATE INDEX |\n| `ups` | INSERT ... ON CONFLICT |\n\nThis extension runs no code and asks for no permissions. It is built with the [language contribution](https://ferrum.vyloxi.com/docs/languages) format.\n"}}}